<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: SLOVAK JUNE REAL IND OUTPUT UP 7.7PCT YR/YR - SUSR.</title>
<headline>SLOVAK JUNE REAL IND OUTPUT UP 7.7PCT YR/YR - SUSR.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovak June real industrial output rose 7.7 percent year-on-year versus a 0.6 percent year-on-year rise in May, the Slovak Statistical Office (SUSR) said on Wednesday.</p>
